 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "tl": [
    0.4,
    9.6
   ],
   "kind": "VO",
   "text": "Running a business isn't easy. Between customers, marketing, emails and endless paperwork, sometimes it feels like there aren't enough hours in the day."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "tl": [
    10.4,
    19.2
   ],
   "kind": "VO",
   "text": "Then one evening, while searching for a smarter way to work, I discovered something interesting. An AI assistant called Claude."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "tl": [
    20.4,
    29.4
   ],
   "kind": "VO",
   "text": "I started by asking it to help me organise my business tasks, develop marketing ideas and write better responses to my customers."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "tl": [
    30.4,
    39.7
   ],
   "kind": "VO",
   "text": "Suddenly, I had a clearer direction. My ideas were organised, my tasks were easier to plan, and I could focus on growing my business."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "tl": [
    40.4,
    49.6
   ],
   "kind": "VO",
   "text": "From brainstorming to research, writing and planning, Claude became part of my daily workflow. And the best part? I was still in control."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "tl": [
    50.3,
    58.5
   ],
   "kind": "ON CAMERA",
   "text": "Sometimes, you don't need more hands. You need a smarter way to work. Discover Claude. What would you create with it?"
  }
 ]
}